<section class="bg-brand-navy text-white py-24 px-8 border-b border-gray-800">
  <div
    class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-start"
  >
    <!-- Left Column: Text -->
    <div>
      <p class="text-brand-green font-body text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 font-light">
        Meet the person doing the work
      </p>

      <h2
        class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-heading mb-12 leading-tight font-bold text-white"
      >
        I listen.<br />
        I think.<br />
        I act.
      </h2>

      <p
        class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-body text-gray-300 leading-relaxed font-light mb-16"
      >
        After 15+ years in B2B marketing, I saw the same pattern again and
        again. Leaders who treated their brand seriously always had healthier
        pipelines. Through our 'done-for-you' branding and marketing services,
        we handle your positioning, content, and relationships - so you can
        focus on what you do best... growing your business.
      </p>

      <h3
        class="text-brand-green font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-8 font-bold"
      >
        Why clients stay
      </h3>

      <ul class="space-y-4 text-xl font-body text-gray-200 font-light">
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6 text-white mr-4 mt-1 shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="3"
              d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
          >
          <span>You deal directly with me</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6 text-white mr-4 mt-1 shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="3"
              d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
          >
          <span>Advice is clear, practical and commercially grounded</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6 text-white mr-4 mt-1 shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="3"
              d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
          >
          <span>I keep things straightforward and transparent</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6 text-white mr-4 mt-1 shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="3"
              d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
          >
          <span>I remain involved after launch</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Image & Bio -->
    <div class="lg:pl-8">
      <img
        src="/about/about-me.png"
        alt="Taz Burwaiss"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded shadow-2xl mb-8"
      />
      <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold mb-1 text-white">
        Taz Burwaiss
      </h3>
      <p class="font-body text-xl text-gray-400 mb-6 font-light">Founder</p>
      <p class="font-body text-xl leading-relaxed text-white font-light">
        Personal brand strategist and<br />
        LinkedIn expert with a<br />
        passion for clarity and<br />
        getting to the heart of what<br />
        makes businesses different.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
